WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.102
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:05.638
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.374
Now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:10.710
In a speech last week at the
Volvo truck plant in Maryland,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.413
President Biden said, "Let me
start off with two words --

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:16.015
made in America."

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.550
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.920
And then it only got worse when
he said, "Sorry, I meant four."

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.622
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.056
President Biden
announced last week

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:26.158
that he will pardon thousands
of individuals

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:29.361
convicted of simple marijuana
possession and said,

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:31.097
"No one should be in jail

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.432
just for using
or possessing marijuana,

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:36.268
because, after all,
if you smoke enough marijuana,

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:38.872
your couch is the jail."

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.341
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.209
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.145
convened a meeting today at
his National Security Council.

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.413
There were no survivors.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.915
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:53.652
Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen
said in an interview yesterday

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:56.489
that OPEC's decision
to reduce oil output

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.090
will harm the global economy.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.426
It's what OPEC is calling
"the point."

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.829
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.031
At his rally in Nevada
over the weekend,

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.999
former President Trump claimed

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:09.735
"two years ago, everything
was so good in our country,

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:10.970
and now it's going to pieces."

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.673
Man, I can hardly remember.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.009
I mean, what was
happening two years ago?

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.176
Oh, yeah.

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:18.711
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.279
Yeah, those were --

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:21.881
those were good times.

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.215
[ Applause, cheers ]

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:26.219
A federal judge in New York
last week issued a ruling

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.420
that blocked several parts
of a new state law

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.090
that banned guns
in sensitive areas

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.826
like museums, stadiums,
and Times Square,

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:37.663
because everyone knows the only
way to stop a bad guy with a gun

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:40.600
is a drunk Elmo
with nothing to lose.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.769
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.070
The NFL announced
over the weekend

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.473
that it will update
its concussion protocol,

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:49.608
and then in a troubling sign,

00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:51.277
they announced it again.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:54.347
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.819
According to a new survey,
26% of Americans believe

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.854
there should be a minimum age
requirement

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.422
for getting ears pierced,

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:04.890
while over in Jersey,

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.293
there's a Claire's
in the maternity ward.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.729
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:16.902
That was my favorite one.

00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:18.804
I got to be honest with you.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:22.408
Today was former NFL quarterback
Brett Favre's 53rd birthday,

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:26.279
and even his cake was stolen
from needy children.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.881
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:31.417
Oh, did we ruin his birthday?

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.085
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:34.920
[ Laughs ]

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.423
And finally, after a video
getting attention online

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.192
of a woman in a bikini
getting out of a city fire truck

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:41.728
in front of a strip club,

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.762
the mayor of San Jose
announced last week

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:46.099
that an investigation
has been launched,

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.067
and the only way
they're getting away with this

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.670
is if that woman
was stuck in a tree.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.774
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.075
Shot that in Central Park today.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:57.276
She was great.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:58.945
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

